@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
skinparam ArrowColor #CBD5E1
title Proposed versioned configuration and restricted secret delivery
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

artifact "Versioned non-secret release/configuration schema\nRequired keys, types, compatibility and provenance" as V
rectangle "Actual environment policy / approved values\nNo invented defaults or enabled features" as E
rectangle "Restricted secret/key source\nMechanism and recovery procedure pending" as S
rectangle "Validate / compose effective configuration\nEnvironment + release identity + required scope" as C
component "Web runtime" as W
component "Worker / scheduler / adapters" as J
rectangle "Restricted effective-identity observation\nNames/versions only, not secret values" as O
V --> C
E --> C
S --> C : scoped secret access
C --> W
C --> J
W --> O
J --> O
legend bottom
 Configuration changes require compatibility, authority, rotation and recovery assessment.
 Never copy production secrets into dev/staging/jobs or expose configuration dumps in diagnostics.
 No vault, config server, runtime feature-flag service or hot-reload mechanism is selected.
endlegend
@enduml
